---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use | Sandstone Stucco Co"
  description="Terms for using sandstonestucco.ca, an advertising service for independent Calgary stucco contractors."
  canonical="https://sandstonestucco.ca/terms/"
>
<style is:global>
  .rich p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #3A332C; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich li { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #3A332C; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .rich h2 { font-size: 24px; color: #7A5A32; margin: 32px 0 12px; }
  .rich a { color: #4B5D6B; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
<section style="padding:64px 24px;background:#fff;">
  <div class="rich" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;">
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 8px;">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p style="color:#5A5148;font-size:14px;">Last updated 30 September 2026</p>
    <p>These terms apply to your use of sandstonestucco.ca.</p>
    <h2>What this site is</h2>
    <p>Sandstone Stucco Co is an advertising and introduction service. It is paid by independent stucco contractors. It does not do stucco or parging work, does not employ tradespeople, and holds no trade licence, certificate, insurance or warranty. Any contractor you are put in touch with is independent: it inspects the work, quotes you, and contracts with you directly, and it alone is responsible for its work, its pricing and its own licences and insurance. Check any contractor before you hire them.</p>
    <h2>Information on this site</h2>
    <p>Articles and pages on this site are general information, not professional, legal or insurance advice. Prices shown are figures published by the named firms or sources on the dates given; they are not our quotes, and your price comes from a written quote for your own house. We try to keep information accurate and cite our sources, but we do not guarantee it is complete or current.</p>
    <h2>Insurance claims</h2>
    <p>This site does not handle, file, negotiate or manage insurance claims. Contact your insurer about any claim.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for any loss arising from your use of this site or from work done by a contractor you contact through it.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:info@sandstonestucco.ca">info@sandstonestucco.ca</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
